# Backend Architecture Rules
- Use NestJS modular architecture.
- Keep business logic in Services, not Controllers.
- All endpoints must be versioned (`/api/v1/...`).
- Validate incoming payloads with `class-validator` DTOs and `ValidationPipe({ whitelist: true })`.
- Decorate all controllers and DTOs with Swagger `@ApiTags`, `@ApiOperation`, and `@ApiResponse`.
- Server-authoritative assessment timing: calculate expiration server-side.
